    "https://careers.viu.ca/vacancy/opportunity-profile-vice-president-enrolment-and-student-experience-603886.html": {
      "title": "OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Vice President, Enrolment and Student Experience (3023)",
      "description": "OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Vice President, Enrolment and Student Experience (3023) | VIU | Vancouver Island University Skip to main content VIU Future Students International Students Current Students Employees Alumni & Donors Contact Registration Registration Space tasks Map Members Space Structure Registration Site map Parents viu.ca Sections Pages All Sites... All Groups... Site Members Registration Member list Admins admin boquist culvers manhasm2 testuser Members No members OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Vice President, Enrolment and Student Experience (3023) OPPORTUNITY PROFILE: Vice President, Enrolment and Student Experience Vancouver Island University (VIU) is pleased to partner with an external search firm in the recruitment of a Vice-President, Enrolment and Student Experience. This is an exciting leadership opportunity to help shape VIU’s approach to strategic enrolment management and the student experience, with a focus on enrolment recovery and sustainable growth, student success, and accessible, student-centred services. We invite you to learn more about this role and the impact it will have in shaping VIU’s next chapter by reviewing the attached opportunity profile. Please note that all inquiries and applications are being managed directly through the search firm, as outlined in the profile. As outlined in the profile, this search is being supported by Leaders International Executive Search . Employment Group ADMIN Position Number 01049 Division Vice-President Students Department Office of the Vice-President Students Campus Nanaimo campus  *Successful candidates must be able to attend in person on campus as required. Location Nanaimo, British Columbia Country Canada Appointment Type regular full-time Additional Information Open until Filled. First Resume Review: September 17, 2026 Posted Date 07-Aug-2026 Job Reference 3023 Documents Opportunity Profile (PDF , 461.17kb) To apply, please email a cover letter and resume (PDF or Word document, preferably as one document) directly to Leaders International Executive Search and include the role title and organization name in the subject line. FOR MORE INFORMATION, PLEASE CONTACT: Shadyar Shirmast or Greg Longster LEADERS INTERNATIONAL EXECUTIVE SEARCH #1160 - 595 Howe Street Vancouver, BC V6C 2T5 Phone: (604) 688-8422 Email: connect@leadersinternational.com Apply for this job Print this job Send to a friend About VIU Careers at VIU Employee Directory Parking Academics International Students Library Programs and Courses VIU Learn Campuses Nanaimo (Main Campus) Cowichan Parksville-Qualicum Centre tiwšɛmawtxʷ (Powell River) About VIU Why VIU? Careers at VIU Employee Directory VIU Facts Events News Parking University Governance Academics Admission Requirements Dual Credit Financial Aid and Awards Graduate Programs International Students Library Online Education Programs and Courses Registration Transfer Students VIU Learn Student Life Student Housing Campus Recreation Campus Store Food Services Health and Wellness Services for Students VIU Mariners Athletics Campuses Campus Information Nanaimo (Main Campus) Cowichan Parksville-Qualicum Centre tiwšɛmawtxʷ (Powell River) Vancouver Island University Nanaimo (Main Campus) 900 Fifth Street Nanaimo, BC V9R 5S5 Canada 250.753.3245 1.888.920.2221 info@viu.ca Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube LinkedIn VIU RSS feed The VIU community acknowledges and thanks the Snuneymuxw, Quw’utsun and Tla’amin, on whose traditional lands we teach, learn,\n                                                                                        research, live and share knowledge. Accreditation Terms Emergency Information Website Feedback © 2021 Vancouver Island University MENU CLOSE X Future Students International Students Current Students Employees Alumni & Donors Contact VIU Main Menu Open submenu (About VIU) About VIU Open submenu (Programs and Courses) Programs and Courses Open submenu (Admissions) Admissions Facebook Instagram Twitter Yout