tion English as a Second Language (ESL) Exploratory University Studies Open submenu (First Nations) First Nations Graduate Programs Open submenu (Health) Health Open submenu (Human Services) Human Services Natural Resource Extension Program Online Programs / Distance Courses Open submenu (Professional Development and Training) Professional Development and Training Open submenu (Science and Technology) Science and Technology The High School at VIU Open submenu (Tourism, Recreation and Hospitality) Tourism, Recreation and Hospitality Open submenu (Trades and Applied Technology) Trades and Applied Technology Teaching English as a Second or Foreign Language Close submenu (Academic and Career Preparation) Academic and Career Preparation Aboriginal University Bridging Program Certificate Employability Skills Program Foundations for Success Open submenu (High School Equivalency (ABE)) High School Equivalency (ABE) Literacy Workplace Essential Skills and Training Program Close submenu (High School Equivalency (ABE)) High School Equivalency (ABE) BC Adult Graduation Diploma Close submenu (Art, Design and Performing Arts) Art, Design and Performing Arts Open submenu (Art and Design - Arts General Admission Requirements) Art and Design - Arts General Admission Requirements Bachelor of Arts, Minor in Theatre Bachelor of Fine Arts – Theatre Transfer Bachelor of Music – Classical Transfer Bachelor of Music in Jazz Studies Music – Diploma in Jazz Studies Theatre Diploma Close submenu (Art and Design - Arts General Admission Requirements) Art and Design - Arts General Admission Requirements Bachelor of Arts, Visual Art Major and Minor Bachelor of Design in Graphic Design Bachelor of Interior Design Visual Arts Diploma Close submenu (Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences) Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences Open submenu (Bachelor of Arts, Honours, Majors, and Minors) Bachelor of Arts, Honours, Majors, and Minors Addiction Studies Certificate Advanced Diploma in GIS Applicatons Diplo