nity Support Close submenu (Professional Development and Training) Professional Development and Training British Columbia First Nations Building Inspector Building Service Worker Hospital Unit Coordinator Managing Conflict In The Workplace Master Gardener Program Medical Device Reprocessing Technician Medical Office Assistant Professional Esthetics Close submenu (Science and Technology) Science and Technology Open submenu (Bachelor of Science, Majors, Minors and Transfer) Bachelor of Science, Majors, Minors and Transfer Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquaculture Bachelor of Natural Resource Protection Diploma in Computing Science Fisheries and Aquaculture Technology Forest Resources Technology Fundamental of Engineering Certificate Program Post-Degree Diploma in Fisheries and Aquaculture Resource Management Officer Technology Close submenu (Bachelor of Science, Majors, Minors and Transfer) Bachelor of Science, Majors, Minors and Transfer Biology Chemistry Computer Science Earth Science Geography Geoscience Mathematics Physics Psychology Close submenu (Tourism, Recreation and Hospitality) Tourism, Recreation and Hospitality Bachelor of Hospitality Management Bachelor of Tourism Management Culinary Arts Bridging to Bachelor of Hospitality Management Event Management Certificate Hospitality Management Diploma Master of Arts in Sustainable Leisure Management Recreation and Sport Management Graduate Diploma in Sustainable Leisure Management Tourism Studies Wine Business Certificate in Adventure Tourism and Recreation Close submenu (Trades and Applied Technology) Trades and Applied Technology Aboriginal Construction Aluminum Boat Building Applied Business Technology - Online Automotive Service Technician Carpentry Culinary Arts Culinary Management Electrician First Nations Housing Manager Hairdressing Heavy Equipment Operator Heavy Mechanical Trades Foundation Horticultral Technician Foundation Information Technology and Applied Systems Motorcycle and Marine Technic