of Science in Nursing Community Health Promotion for Aboriginal Communities Community Mental Health Worker Dental Assistant Dental Hygiene Graduate Diploma in Gerontology: Active Aging Health Care Assistant Practical Nursing Human Services Bachelor of Arts in Child and Youth Care Bachelor of Social Work Child and Youth Care Leadership and Disability Studies Early Childhood Education and Care School and Community Support Worker Social Services Education Assistand and Community Support Natural Resource Extension Program Online Programs / Distance Courses Professional Development and Training British Columbia First Nations Building Inspector Building Service Worker Hospital Unit Coordinator Managing Conflict In The Workplace Master Gardener Program Medical Device Reprocessing Technician Medical Office Assistant Professional Esthetics Science and Technology Bachelor of Science, Majors, Minors and Transfer Biology Chemistry Computer Science Earth Science Geography Geoscience Mathematics Physics Psychology Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquaculture Bachelor of Natural Resource Protection Diploma in Computing Science Fisheries and Aquaculture Technology Forest Resources Technology Fundamental of Engineering Certificate Program Post-Degree Diploma in Fisheries and Aquaculture Resource Management Officer Technology The High School at VIU Tourism, Recreation and Hospitality Bachelor of Hospitality Management Bachelor of Tourism Management Culinary Arts Bridging to Bachelor of Hospitality Management Event Management Certificate Hospitality Management Diploma Master of Arts in Sustainable Leisure Management Recreation and Sport Management Graduate Diploma in Sustainable Leisure Management Tourism Studies Wine Business Certificate in Adventure Tourism and Recreation Trades and Applied Technology Aboriginal Construction Aluminum Boat Building Applied Business Technology - Online Automotive Service Technician Carpentry Culinary Arts Culinary Management Electrician First Nati